.. rubric:: Grove LED Blinky by GPIO

See also |LED Shields| in Bridle and Zephyr sample:
:zephyr:code-sample:`blinky`.

   .. rubric:: On ARM Cortex-M33

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
      :build-dir: picoboy_color_plus
      :board: picoboy_color_plus/rp2350a/m33
      :shield: "grove_btn_d20_inv grove_led_d21 grove_pwm_led_d21 x_grove_testbed"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

   .. rubric:: On Hazard3 RISC-V (RV32IMAC+)

   .. zephyr-app-commands::
      :app: zephyr/samples/basic/blinky
      :build-dir: picoboy_color_plus
      :board: picoboy_color_plus/rp2350a/hazard3
      :shield: "grove_btn_d20_inv grove_led_d21 grove_pwm_led_d21 x_grove_testbed"
      :west-args: -p
      :goals: flash
      :compact:

